@apiUrl = http://localhost:8081
@projectId = 1
@sprintId = 1

### Get access token
POST {{serverUrl}}/realms/agile-project/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password
&client_id={{clientId}}
&client_secret={{clientSecret}}
&username={{username}}
&password={{password}}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.access_token);
%}

### Sprint summary report (WF-1)
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/analytics/sprints/{{sprintId}}/report
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Sprint burndown chart (WF-3)
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/analytics/sprints/{{sprintId}}/burndown
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Sprint burnup chart (WF-4)
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/analytics/sprints/{{sprintId}}/burnup
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Sprint comparison (WF-5)
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/analytics/projects/{{projectId}}/sprints
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Sprint comparison with date filter (WF-6)
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/analytics/projects/{{projectId}}/sprints?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Sprint comparison CSV export (WF-7)
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/analytics/projects/{{projectId}}/sprints/export?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: text/csv
